# Focus and Input Internals

Coming soon — this page explains the focus and input subsystems:
the `UseFocus` dispatcher coalescing logic, the `UseFocusTrap`
container injection, how pointer / gesture events flow compared to
WinUI's routed events, why `.OnTapped` exists alongside
`.OnPointerPressed`, the AccessKey wiring, and how tab order is
computed. See
[the AI Author Skill](../../_pipeline/ai-author-skill.md) for the
planned surface.

Until then, [Input and Gestures](input-and-gestures.md) and
[Accessibility](accessibility.md) cover the surface APIs.
